# Keep the Docker build context small and secret-free.
# The all-in-one image is built from the repository root (see deploy/free/Dockerfile).
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage.out
**/*.log
**/bin
**/*.exe
**/*.exe~

docs
tests
locales
scripts
*.md
